+---
+name: nexvora-services
+description: Explains what NEXVORA (a technology solutions company based in Egypt) offers and how to start a project or contact the team. Use when a user asks about NEXVORA's services or wants to hire them.
+---
+
+# NEXVORA services
+
+NEXVORA is a technology solutions company based in Egypt serving clients worldwide.
+
+## Services
+Tech Talent, Product Engineering, Web design & Development, Page Speed Optimization, Mobile Applications, WordPress and Shopify, Digital Marketing, Brand Identity & Graphic Design, IT Infrastructure, Managed Hosting Services, Cybersecurity & Recovery Service, AI Consultation.
+Each service has a page at https://nexvoraagency.com/service/<slug>/ (see https://nexvoraagency.com/llms.txt for the full list).
+
+## How to start a project
+Send the user to https://nexvoraagency.com/contact-us/. Do not promise prices, timelines, or availability; the NEXVORA team confirms these directly.
